Z||000008||StuGood||09-19-2001||01:03 PM||||Looks as though quite a few heat shields around the exhaust / EGR valve area are missing.  For example, there is ordinarily supposed to be a sheet steel piece (a vertical wall) between the EGR valve and the ignition coil:<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/a111.jpg">  <P>Sort of off-topic I guess, unless the recalls mentioned repairing/ replacing any damaged/ missing heat shields.  Should be good for coil longevity if nothing else.<P>(Edited to add photo) <p>[This message has been edited by StuGood (edited 09-20-2001).]||||reg||4
